                                    </div>
                                 
                                 <div class="container">
                                    
                                    <h3 class="headline"><a href="/Costs/default.htm">A Great Investment</a></h3>
                                    
                                    <div class="description">Explore scholarship and financial aid options, and see how affordable it is to attend
                                       here.</div>
                                    </div>
                                 </div>			
                              <div class="ContentBlock tout">
                                 
